 Decision: an upload may be at most 50 MB. Why: the print RIP rejects bigger files anyway.
+
+## 2026-10-26 Unused uploads are purged
+Decision: purgeOldUploads deletes every upload that no order uses, whatever its age, and keeps the design files of
+orders. Why: an upload nobody printed is not needed; the disk is full.
